flowchart LR
  S[1 Subassembly build-up] --> I[2 Integration]
  I --> Q1[Inspection / paperwork] --> F[3 Functional test]
  F -- pass --> E[4 Environmental test<br/>vibration + thermal vacuum chamber]
  F -- fail --> I
  E -- pass --> Q2[Inspection / paperwork]
  E -- fail --> M[5 Material review board]
  M -- use as is --> Q3[Inspection / paperwork]
  M -- rework --> I
  M -- scrap --> X((Scrap))
  Q2 --> Q3
  Q3 --> A[6 Final acceptance + ship]
